        },
        {
          "word": " more?",
          "start": 603.94,
          "end": 604.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Where is it? Where is it?\" So, it never ends. The more you have, the more you want.",
      "start": 604.5,
      "end": 610.01,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
